    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game with a couple of hens and turn your plot into an entire farm that can produce various kinds of natural products and other useful things. And all that would be fine, but what's with all the glitches around? Can't do without the trusty shotgun once again?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful farm simulator with a pinch of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of quests and items available along the progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of the puzzles behind the deceptive picture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by great games like Stacklands and Happy Sheepies, but keeps the crazy tradition of Ells Tales.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game with a couple of hens and turn your plot into an entire farm that can produce various kinds of natural products and other useful things. And all that would be fine, but what's with all the glitches around? Can't do without the trusty shotgun once again?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful farm simulator with a pinch of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of quests and items available along the progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of the puzzles behind the deceptive picture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by great games like Stacklands and Happy Sheepies, but keeps the crazy tradition of Ells Tales.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a relaxing game with crafting, resource management, and the care of chickens. Meet the chickens' needs, create and sell different products and keep everyone happy! Wait, but what kind of glitches are these?",
